    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the speech_client.py file, I need to write a Python script that provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Text-to-Speech. I will use the Google Cloud Text-to-Speech API for this task, as it is a concrete third-party managed service. The script will include the necessary imports, configuration setup, and a helper function to synthesize speech. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864167242,
          "start": 1789864164808
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc37bdc80017K1iwLnfcPygha",
