        "text": "<thinking> To fulfill the user's request, I need to create a Python script that interacts with a concrete external provider to list or select a voice for a target locale. I will use the Amazon Polly service for this task, as it is a well-known service for text-to-speech conversion and provides a variety of voices and locales. The script will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with Amazon Polly. </thinking>\n",
