    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To synthesize SSML with voice and prosody controls, I can use the Amazon Polly service, which is a text-to-speech service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. I will write a Python script that uses the boto3 library to interact with Amazon Polly. The script will take SSML input and output an audio stream. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864147290,
          "start": 1789864144241
        },
        "type": "text"
